# Description:
# This script performs preprocessing, integration, clustering, annotation,
# differential expression analysis, and pathway enrichment analysis for
# stromal vascular fraction (SVF) single-cell RNA-seq datasets derived from
# epididymal (eWAT) and inguinal (iWAT) adipose tissues under different
